WEBVTT

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:14.830
Enough's--

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.040
This guy is <i>way </i>hard to handle.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.580
He ain't that strong, exactly...

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.630
But he moves so fast,
I can't hardly get at him!

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.220
Hell, he might even be a match for
Kyou Kai when it comes to speed!

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.720
Kyou Kai...

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.580
Fifth death in a row.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.880
I'm putting all of my breathing
into speed right now...

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.210
...but still, you went down too easy.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.300
Do you want to know the secret?

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.680
Sure.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.890
"Sure"?

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:16.680
You mean I gotta do <i>that </i>again?

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.430
Those are the rules.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.060
Enlighten me, I beg of you,
O great Kyou Kai.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.270
Very well!

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.820
Yes, I move with speed.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:33.910
But it's not that your
reactions aren't keeping up.

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:36.660
How come I keep missin', then?

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:41.080
Because I've been <i>baiting</i>
you into missing.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.290
Huh?

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:45.000
My movements are so fast

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.380
that you're swinging your
sword before I'm in place.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:52.760
But the accuracy of your reactions
makes them easy to lead.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.510
Like, "When I move like <i>this</i>,
he'll do <i>that</i>."

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.930
So you were<i> making </i>me miss.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:06.020
Experts who fight with speed
will bait you quite skillfully.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:10.190
While you swing away,
they'll get into your rhythm

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.440
and finish you off.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:16.160
Though you'll lose your
head if you stay put, too.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.030
Then what am I supposed to do?!

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.240
That's for <i>you </i>to figure out.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.040
But basically...

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:35.680
I'm getting there.

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.180
We've almost clicked!

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.850
Basically?

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.100
Don't take the bait.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:46.690
He didn't bite! <i>And </i>he fell back?

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:49.480
He's still trying to run.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.780
Idiot. At that speed, you'll never--

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:58.160
Wha--ridiculous!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:01.120
Here I am fighting this punk...

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:02.790
...and <i>he's </i>baiting <i>me</i>!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:07.830
He got 'im!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.540
--Whoa!
--Go, Shin!

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:14.710
For one of the Three Greats,
you sure are a lightweight!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.430
A Secret Revealed

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.730
What the--? So fast!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:54.940
Kaine!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:02.240
"Sho"

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:02.160
If you ever have nowhere
to go, come find me.

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.120
Ka Ryo Ten!

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.620
You! You tried to shoot me!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.760
What are you doing, Kaine?
That's the Hi Shin Force's tactician!

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.630
Take her head already!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.050
I know, I know!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.300
Tch.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.680
We're taking her prisoner! Carry her down!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:30.810
Huh?

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.060
What's so special about--

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.440
Shut up! Those are orders!

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:36.480
What a pain...

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.440
Whoa! Shin, look!

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.280
Ten!

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:48.120
Dammit. What am I even <i>doing</i>?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:52.160
You bastards!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.750
He's coming to save Ka Ryo Ten!

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:08.850
No!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.020
Shit!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.100
Ka Ryo Ten!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.440
What are you doin', Ten?!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.150
Let her fall already!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.990
I owe a debt to Kaine!

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:27.490
Doesn't matter! She's the enemy!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:31.160
Oh! That's Captain Kaine!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:33.500
You down there! Catch the captain!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.790
Whenever you're ready!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.000
Okay.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.840
Come with me, Ka Ryo Ten!

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.260
No harm will come to you.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.930
Sai's bound to fall!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:50.760
Sai will <i>not </i>fall! And even if it does...

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:54.310
...I'll die right alongside my comrades!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.770
You leave me no choice.
I can't let an enemy tactician get away.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:05.030
Slant-Eyes! Let go or I'll
stab her in the throat!

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.860
No way, you bitch!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.570
Shin! What are you doing?!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.620
Perfect timing, Bi Hei!

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.660
Kill the enemy captain who's
danglin' off this wall!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.080
Oh! Got it!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:29.090
Here comes Kaine!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.300
Our pleasure!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.180
Miss!

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:37.270
Are you all right, miss?

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.190
Ten! What's the big idea?!

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:40.110
The hell were--

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:43.820
I <i>know</i>! I was wrong!

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:47.490
What I did... was wrong...

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.950
I'm sorry.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:51.990
Next time... Next time I'll do it right.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:03.040
Who do you think you are,
leaving the great Fu Tei behind?

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.920
Whoa! He's still around!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.720
Stand back, you two!

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:10.760
You just let go of Kaine, didn't you?
<i>Didn't you</i>?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.970
That was my future bride
you dropped, damn you!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.060
Get over here!

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:15.970
Tch!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.140
You bastards!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:18.600
I'll kill you all--

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:24.110
Hey--

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.490
Here comes Fu Tei!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.990
Nuts. They just <i>had </i>to catch him, too.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.790
All right, gang! Time to regroup!

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.210
Who is it?

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.460
Who could have raised the
civilian soldiers' morale so high?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.710
The Second Night

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:55.010
Is <i>this </i>night attack a
fake-out like the last one?

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.180
They've got actual
ladders with 'em tonight!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:02.400
Odds are this is a trick to
keep us from getting any rest.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:06.610
Then we command half our
troops to rest, as planned.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:08.070
Right, Ka Ryo Ten?

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:10.990
Ka Ryo Ten!

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:13.240
Huh? Oh... uh-huh.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:25.790
The civilian troops won't be able
to sleep, even if we tell them to.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.760
They'll be even more exhausted tomorrow.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:35.050
If only I'd noticed earlier
yesterday and let them rest...

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.430
I made them wear themselves
out till dawn, and for what?

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:43.900
Then I go and save Kaine's life...

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.940
What's <i>wrong </i>with me?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.480
I'm the worst...

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:51.530
If Sai falls...

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.740
...and Chin perishes...

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.660
...it'll all be my fault!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.840
Nope! Can't sleep, dammit!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.260
Be quiet and lie down, Bi Hei.

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:16.300
You're just playin' into their hands.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:19.140
This is pretty bad, though, Shin.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:23.690
If it's hard on us battlefield veterans,
think of the civilians.

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:25.230
Yeah.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.690
But we ain't got a choice.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.400
<i>We </i>should get some rest, at least.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.360
Huh?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.160
Pardon the interruption.

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.450
Y-Your Highness!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.410
No, don't stand. At ease.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:46.880
Y-Your Highness... what brings
you to a place like this?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:51.420
Since we can't sleep anyway,
I thought I'd offer my thanks.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.760
You have all fought the
good fight these last two days.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.840
We are unworthy, Sire!

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:01.510
For Your Highness to
speak to the likes of us...

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:06.190
At this rate, tomorrow will bring
an even more challenging fight.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:09.980
But the enemy has a weakness
in its lack of supplies.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.610
If we draw this out,
<i>they </i>will be in distress.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.410
So do <i>not </i>give up--no matter what!

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.740
Yes, Sire!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.790
Y-Your Highness?

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.910
We'll be joining the reserves
on the ground tomorrow.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.170
My brother and I will do our very best!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.590
With such courageous
brothers as you two around,

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:35.630
the south wall will be safe tomorrow.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.510
What are your names?

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.550
I'm Ki.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.760
Kou!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:45.230
Ki, Kou. Fight hard tomorrow.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.430
Yes, Sire!

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.270
Apologies. I'll take my leave.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.940
I have others yet to see.

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:55.610
Remember this, everyone:

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.610
We'll speak again tomorrow night!

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.500
Yes, Your Highness!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.500
All right, folks, let's lie down!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.210
Rest up--even the
tiniest bit--for tomorrow!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.750
East Wall

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:22.140
You have been fighting for a
good cause these last two days.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:25.770
I suspect that fighting amid the
pain of having lost Lord Hyou

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:29.140
may only lead to further suffering.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:32.690
But I ask your indulgence again tomorrow.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:36.690
We deeply appreciate
Your Highness's considerate words.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.910
But we come to you a suicide corps.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:42.660
We fools who failed to follow
in our lord's footsteps

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:45.370
had decided this is where we die.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:48.830
We will shed every last drop of our blood,
taking as many enemies with us

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.500
as we possibly can!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.960
I cannot allow it.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.760
It is no mistake that you
are here today, alive.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:02.640
The heavens have given
you a great role to play.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:05.560
A role?

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:09.020
To be the mighty strength
that defends Sai.

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:10.230
And...

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:16.780
...to tell generations to come
about the hero Lord Hyou.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:23.490
You alone can do so--you who have
shed blood and sweat beside him,

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.280
who have borne witness
to his final moments.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.160
It is a role no one else
could ever fulfill.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.130
So <i>live</i>, soldiers of Lord Hyou--
and defend Sai to the last!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.380
Do you hear me?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.630
Yes, Sire!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:48.010
North Wall

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.970
Oh, Your Highness...

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:55.230
I see... if they can't sleep,
may as well lift their spirits.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.320
Still, it's striking:

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:00.240
the sudden change that's come
over the civilian troops--

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:03.490
the glimmer in their eyes...

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:08.200
So <i>that's </i>the King of Chin who so
inspired my master, Shou Hei Kun:

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:10.080
Ei Sei.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.370
West Wall

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:20.880
He's way more awesome than I even thought.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.170
Of course he is.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.180
Idiot.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:29.100
Think we can pull it off tomorrow,
Shou Bun Kun?

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:32.520
You been doin' this a lot longer than me.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.980
I don't know.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:41.780
Fighting after two nights with no
sleep--that's unknown territory.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:44.990
And with half our ranks civilians...

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.870
Can't really tell, huh.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:47.820
No.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:53.040
Not that I'm chickenin' out or anything,
but I just wanna check something.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:15:00.090
When you left Kanyou,
you musta done some calculations.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:04.720
Like, how long we need to stick it out.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.560
Eight days.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.430
Based on?

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.480
It's not really <i>based on </i>anything, per se.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.610
Just... eight days.

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:20.980
Eight days.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.360
Wish I'd never asked.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.400
Right.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.570
And I shouldn't have told you.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.240
Getting through tomorrow may
be nothing short of miraculous.

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.960
And it'll go on for five
more days after <i>that</i>.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.630
We've been driven this far into a corner.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:44.510
Soon it'll take a miracle
to find our way out.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:48.970
And I ain't a big fan of relyin' on those.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.390
Nor am I.

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.640
A miracle, eh?

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.940
Now, then:

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:06.020
Day 3

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.690
Let's end this.

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:09.030
Hai Rou, go over by
Bi Hei and help out!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.450
Tch. Got it!

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.580
En!

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:13.910
They're lookin' thin on
the ground by Den Ei!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.450
Y-Yes, sir!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:19.500
Dammit. Losin' Den Yuu and
Ryuu Sen left massive holes, all right.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.960
And my troops are pretty
sluggish themselves.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:27.170
At this rate, the civilian troops'll be...

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.390
Push on through!

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:35.270
Oh, man...

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.850
We'll be destroyed--just like <i>that</i>.

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:42.150
Not yet.

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:43.440
We're just getting started.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:51.200
Wh-What the--?

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.790
These bastards--they're...

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.670
They're <i>back</i>!

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:04.670
We're not done for yet!
We can still fight!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.510
Shin! The civilian troops!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.050
Yeah...

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:10.970
They're still holdin' on.

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:14.300
They still ain't lost
their fightin' spirit!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.480
Just how much did you
boost their morale, Sei?

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:27.610
The same happened atop
each of the four castle walls.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:31.070
Having made it this far,
Sai staged a comeback

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:35.580
and began fighting off the
surging Ri Boku Army head-on.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:36.580
Forget losing!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:40.250
--Defend Sai!
--We'll keep Sai safe!

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:43.040
What is <i>happening </i>with this castle?

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.380
Makin' the rounds again tonight?

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.680
Yes.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.720
Rest up a little, Sei.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:57.060
You're the one holdin' the place together.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.350
Yes. I know.

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:02.850
Still ain't had that nice long chat.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.060
True.

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.480
Something to look forward
to when this is over.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.690
Yeah.

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:17.780
Sire!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.330
Your Highness...

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:25.250
All soldiers are under a gag order,

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:29.550
so Ri Boku likely won't have
realized the King is here.

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:33.010
The other side probably doesn't
know <i>what's </i>going on.

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:38.100
That's the one instance where
we've got the upper hand.

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:43.140
With the King at its core, Sai is
undergoing a transformation...

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:45.310
...into a fighting castle.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:51.360
The Fourth Evening

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:51.280
We made it through the fourth day!

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:58.410
This extraordinary castle...

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:02.870
Even having Ou Ki in
there wouldn't cause all this.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.370
If it's not the might
of a military leader...

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.960
...only one person comes to mind.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.670
But can it really be true?

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:17.390
That night, Ri Boku's army
didn't merely shout,

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.890
but launched a real attack.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:23.890
Though this night attack was more
grueling than their daytime battle,

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.520
Sai nevertheless made it through.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:32.690
Day 5

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:36.990
Three more days... just three more days!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.830
Wh-What's this?!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:47.250
The civilians are droppin'
like flies--outta nowhere!

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.170
Th-They're dead!

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.750
Here, too!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.130
So this is it--their <i>real </i>limit!

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:58.970
This kid's got some spring in his step!

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.850
Die, you raggedy brat!

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.810
Don't die yet! You must not leave us!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:15.900
Sei! What are you doing?!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.610
Do not collapse! Stay awake!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.620
The fight is not yet over!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:22.990
Your Highness...

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:26.620
Our King himself, on the front lines...

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:30.420
This is no time to be dead, my friends!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:34.130
They... They're fighting again?!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.720
Sei...

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.590
B-But it's day five!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:44.060
Where are they finding this strength?!

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:48.940
The King himself stands on the
front lines, inspiring the troops...

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:51.270
This is all I have left to offer.

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.740
You civilian troops...

00:20:56.740 --> 00:21:00.820
Forgive your King for
denying you peace in death.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.030
That's enough--let's fall back!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:05.410
It's dangerous to get
caught up in this momentum!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.790
The danger is what gives it meaning!

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.080
Captain, they're pushing us back!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.960
That flashy-looking kid...

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:16.090
The civilian troops caught their
second wind after <i>he </i>showed up.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:17.630
You! Come with me!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.840
Sir!

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:24.760
My lord! New troops are
circling in from the left!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.510
You! You're skilled!

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.720
Sir!

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:32.020
A cluster of boy soldiers!

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:33.100
Let's go!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.940
My lord, please, fall back!

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:40.700
Let's finish off these spearmen!

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:44.490
That flashy kid even
has crack bodyguards...

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:47.200
You kids are in the way! Get down below!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:50.960
B-But they said to come up here,
that there weren't enough troops.

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.170
Look, just get--

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:55.840
Stray arrows?!

00:21:58.510 --> 00:21:59.710
Gotcha!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:04.130
Wha--?

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:05.350
Captain Sou!

00:22:07.350 --> 00:22:08.470
No!

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.020
Kill him!

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:25.070
Your Highness!

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:26.120
Huh?!

00:22:26.120 --> 00:22:28.580
D-Did they say "Your Highness"?

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:32.370
I get it now... So <i>that's</i>
what was going on!

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:35.460
Behead that man this instant!

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:38.750
Stop!

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:45.840
Who the hell are you?!

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:49.310
Never mind him! It's <i>this </i>guy!

00:22:49.310 --> 00:22:51.890
Lop his glittery head clean off!

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:01.940
Shit!

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:02.940
Damn you!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:04.150
<i>I'll </i>do it!

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:10.740
Sei! Hey! Stay with me, now!

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:13.460
Sei! C'mon!

00:23:13.460 --> 00:23:15.670
Open your eyes!

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:19.000
Sei!

00:24:52.510 --> 00:25:02.020
With All We Have

00:24:54.180 --> 00:24:58.020
Next on <i>Kingdom</i>: "With All We Have."
